; haltsql-console tests. Helpers starts an in-process console on an ephemeral port with
; a temporary state dir and lets tests preload the record index; every feature PR adds
; its own test_<feature>.ml next to test_console.ml (scaffold: config, RBAC, router,
; store, index, auth, health).

